    "schema": "sparkglm.atlas-engine-source/v2",
    "note": "Unified SparkGLM release: TP2 and TP4, Strict and Spark modes, native MTP, corrected FP4 weight rounding, native FP8 MLA fusion, sparse attention ABI2, and explicit switchless chain/ring. Release qualification and source-export provenance are recorded under results/2026-10-21-unified-release. The accepted source export preserves the qualified runtime code; one documentation example uses a public example address.",
